{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13060","headline":"盖少府新除江南尉问风俗 · 郎士元","name":"盖少府新除江南尉问风俗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君作尉向江潭，吴越风烟到自谙。\n客路寻常随竹影，人家大底傍山岚。\n缘溪花木偏宜远，避地衣冠尽向南。\n惟有夜猨啼海树，思乡望国意难堪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}